Author: willsthewolf

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: ShinyCounter

Summary: On-screen encounter counter for shiny hunting

Description: |
  Shows an encounter counter on the bottom screen while you play.

  Controls:
    - L + Up: +1
    - L + Down: -1
    - L + Left: show / hide
    - Select: plugin menu

  Based on CTRPluginFramework by Nanquitas and the blank template by PabloMK7.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
